ure to avoid unrelated setup work. Arrange\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"CHANGELOG.md:65\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Do not satisfy it solely by inserting fixture records or by display-test projection.\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"CHANGELOG.md:90\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Lite 平台的 `REQ-2.1`、`REQ-2.2`、`REQ-2.4`、`REQ-2.5`、`REQ-3.1`、`REQ-3.2` 等失败都在 `helpers.ts:24`：通过 `navigation` 区域查找精确名为 `Books` 的链接时匹配了两个元素。生成应用的 `BookPage.tsx` 同时有顶部导航的 `Books` 链接与 `<nav aria-label=\\\"Breadcrumbs\\\">` 中的 `Books` 链接。平台的 `strict mode violation` 发生在业务断言之前。`REQ-2.3` 的取消场景另有 10 秒超时，不能仅凭该错误归为同一原因。\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"CHANGELOG.md:110\",\r\n        \"text\": \"修改前，测试指令只要求通过 UI ID 或可访问定位器执行动作。修改后新增：\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"CHANGELOG.md:235\",\r\n        \"text\": \"同次运行的 `REQ-2.4 Save metadata changes` 也超时；取消编辑通过。仅有总超时和测试源码，无法确认其卡点，故本版**不声称修复 REQ-2.4**。此外，缺少逐步 trace，Page list 区域是三个页面用例的明确不匹配点，但不能断言它是这些超时的唯一原因。\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"CHANGELOG.md:332\",\r\n        \"text\": \"locator, data-testid, direct URL, or fixture insertion for this action. This\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/api.py:24\",\r\n        \"text\": \"DEFAULT_INTENT = \\\"\\\"\\\"为费用报销工作台编写独立的 Playwright 测试用例：\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/api.py:42\",\r\n        \"text\": \"每个函数只写逐行 await 调用，不使用变量、循环、分支、装饰器、fixture、其他 import。\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/api.py:43\",\r\n        \"text\": \"支持 page 和定位器的 get_by_role/get_by_label/get_by_text/get_by_test_id/locator；定位器还支持 nth 和 filter(has_text=\\\"文本\\\")。\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/api.py:45\",\r\n        \"text\": \"支持 await expect(定位器).to_have_text/to_contain_text/to_have_count/to_have_value/to_be_visible/to_be_hidden/to_be_enabled/to_be_disabled。\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/api.py:47\",\r\n        \"text\": \"每个测试至少有一个业务断言。总共不超过 12 个用例，每个用例不超过 60 步。\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/runner.py:39\",\r\n        \"text\": \"raise ValueError(\\\"仅支持 page 定位、操作与 expect 断言\\\")\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/runner.py:42\",\r\n        \"text\": \"raise ValueError(\\\"expect 只接受一个定位器\\\")\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/runner.py:45\",\r\n        \"text\": \"raise ValueError(\\\"expect 必须作用于页面定位器\\\")\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/runner.py:63\",\r\n        \"text\": \"raise ValueError(f\\\"不支持 {kind}.{method}；只允许课堂页面操作与断言\\\")\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/runner.py:120\",\r\n        \"text\": \"raise ValueError(\\\"测试内仅支持 await 页面操作或断言，不使用变量、循环、分支\\\")\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/runner.py:123\",\r\n        \"text\": \"raise ValueError(\\\"每一步必须是页面操作或断言\\\")\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/runner.py:131\",\r\n        \"text\": \"raise ValueError(\\\"每个测试至少包含一个 expect 断言\\\")\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/browser_testing/runner.py:136\",\r\n        \"text\": \"raise ValueError(\\\"请生成 1～12 个独立测试用例\\\")\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/lesson-model-cost.html:338\",\r\n        \"text\": \"<p class=\\\"lead\\\">描述测试步骤 → 生成脚本 → 执行并发现失败<br>→ 提出修复 → Apply → 用同一份测试再次验证</p>\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/lesson-model-cost.html:358\",\r\n        \"text\": \"<p class=\\\"footnote\\\">GUI 是图形用户界面；“断言”就是写进测试中的预期结果。Playwright 可执行操作，并等待界面满足断言。<a href=\\\"https://playwright.dev/python/docs/test-assertions\\\">Playwright 断言文档</a></p>\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/lesson-model-cost.html:372\",\r\n        \"text\": \"<p><strong>本节实践使用 Playwright 功能测试。</strong><br>明确的金额与业务规则用断言检查；视觉判断需要明确标准并复核。</p>\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/lesson-model-cost.html:408\",\r\n        \"text\": \"<pre class=\\\"prompt-text\\\">请为当前费用报销工作台生成三个独立的 Playwright 测试用例：\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/lesson-model-cost.html:436\",\r\n        \"text\": \"<tr><td>添加两笔费用</td><td>全部费用合计 ¥20.00</td><td>显示最后一笔的 ¥7.50，合计断言失败</td></tr>\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"course_exercises/lesson-model-cost.html:443\",\r\n        \"text\": \"<p class=\\\"footnote\\\">至少应发现合计问题。模型可能加入额外断言，因此失败用例数量以实际为准；不要把预期值改成 ¥7.50 来“通过”。</p>\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"infrastructure/pipeline/backend_implementation.py:24\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Import { createApiTest, fixturePasswordHash } as needed from task.support_module with a\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"infrastructure/pipeline/backend_implementation.py:52\",\r\n        \"text\": \"fixture arguments or password encodings. Initialization loads db/seeds/ENTITY.sql; reuse\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"infrastructure/pipeline/backend_implementation.py:67\",\r\n        \"text\": \"feedback, not proof the test is wrong. During generation repair test syntax/fixtures and\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"infrastructure/pipeline/backend_implementation.py:84\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Use the supplied test utilities and generated tests to understand existing fixture data\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"location\": \"infrastructure/pipeline/backend_implementation.py:91\",\r\n        \"text\": \"no DB-access primitive layer is generated. The compiler owns the HTTP test runner and fixture.\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n   